d in an unlikely place.","宝石は思いがけない場所で見つかった。","","found"],["I was given a hard time by a strange guy at the tavern.","居酒屋で変なおっさんにからまれた。","","given"]]},"conditional-2":{"o":["would","will","did","had"],"s":[["Who would care?","誰も気にしませんよ。","","would"],["I would like to live in luxury.","贅沢な暮らしをしたい。","","would"],["Jonathan Swift would defend me.","ジョナサン・スウィフトなら私を弁護するでしょう。","","would"],["How would you analyze the situation?","状況をどう分析しますか。","","would"],["That would be physically impossible.","それは肉体的に無理だよ。","","would"],["Just stick to the protocol, would you?","プロトコルだけに固執すればいい、分かった？","","would"],["I would like to have my teeth straightened.","歯の矯正をしたいんです。","","would"],["One day I, too, would like to be a mean old hag.","いつか私も、意地悪ばあさんになってみたいものだわ。","","would"],["If I were reborn, I would want to learn the violin.","生まれ変わったらヴァイオリン習いたい。","","would"],["How would you do a reef knot that is difficult to untie?","解けにくい固結びってどうやるの？","","would"]]},"gerund-infinitive":{"o":["to","for","at","of"],"s":[["I want to cry.","泣きたいんだよ。","","to"],["I want to win.","勝ちたいなぁ。","","to"],["I need to pee.","おしっこしたい。","","to"],["He wants to go.","彼は行きたがっています。","","to"],["I want to play.","遊びたい！","","to"],["We want to win.","勝ちたいなぁ。","","to"],["I decided to go.","私は行くと決めた。","","to"],["I wanted to die.","死にたかったんです。","","to"],["No need to worry.","悪いところはありません。","","to"],["I want to attend.","出席したい。","","to"]]},"reported":{"o":["said","told","asked"],"s":[["Who said that?","誰がそんなこと言ったの？","","said"],["I told you no!","ダメって、言ったでしょ！","","told"],["They asked him.","彼らは彼に聞きました。","","asked"],["Easier said than done.","実行するより口で言うほうが容易だ。","","said"],["Nobody told me.","誰も教えてはくれなかった。","","told"],["Tom asked for directions.","トムは方向を聞いた。","","asked"],["They said it was urgent.","それ、至急だって。","","said"],["I told you before!","言っただろ！","","told"],["I asked for their approval.","私は彼らの賛成を求めた。","","asked"],["\"Moo, moo,\" said the cow.","「モーモー」と牛は鳴いた。","","said"]]}}}